OL,3,GGrampian                               
OL,5,CToday:FThis morning will be mainly dry 
OL,6,Fand cloudy. This afternoon will be     
OL,7,Fcloudy with rain spreading northeast,  
OL,8,Falthough rain patchy across Moray.     
OL,9,FStrong southeasterly wind along the    
OL,10,Feast Aberdeenshire coast.              
OL,12,CTonight:FRain will clear away          
OL,13,Fnortheastwards this evening. Then the  
OL,14,Frest of the night will be dry with     
OL,15,Fvariable amounts of cloud and clear    
OL,16,Fperiods. Patchy frost in the west.     
OL,18,CSunday:FAfter a dry and bright start   
OL,19,Fshowery rain, possibly heavy, will     
OL,20,Fspread east for a time in the morning. 
OL,21,FMainly dry and bright in the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
